<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Catra Does a Diplomacy</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Soon after She-Ra defeated Horde Prime, Catra is on a mission to the Crimson Wastes and runs into some unexpected people.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-----&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It was Lonnieâ€™s turn to smirk. It was like old times, Catra would be picking on them and Adora would step in and put a stop to it. Only this time the stakes were a lot higher than stealing Kyleâ€™s ration bars. Lonnie couldnâ€™t resist shooting a mocking comment at Catra. â€œLooks like you just canâ€™t escape She-Ra.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;However Catra was smiling, fangs out. She took a few steps back, deeper into the shadows. â€œOh, I have a secret weapon now.â€&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>RabidOtter</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
